# gateway (data plane). Secrets (B12) are file secrets: gateway_tenant_keys (R26, one sbl_live_
# key per fronted tenant) and gateway_ingest_key (an ingest:write key; gateway keys lack that
# scope) are minted with the tenant CLI after first boot, then `docker compose up -d gateway`;
# empty is valid (the gateway serves fail-open from disk). key_pepper and scrub_salt are shared
# with the control plane. The pinned first snapshot signing key is the public config
# env/public/snapshot_pin.json (init-env.sh).
# Same env as the control plane (see control.env.example): the local demo is `live`.
SIBYL_ENV=live
SIBYL_LOG_LEVEL=info
